@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Editor
participant "Map Editor System" as System

activate Editor

    Editor -> System : asks to create a map
    activate System


    System --> Editor : requests data (size and name of the map)
    deactivate System


    Editor -> System : types requested data
    activate System


    System --> Editor : shows all data and displays operation success
    deactivate System


@enduml